          "en": [
            "The models are named Gemma 4.",
            "They are described as Google DeepMind's most intelligent open models to date.",
            "They are purpose-built for advanced reasoning and agentic workflows."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "该模型系列名为Gemma 4。",
            "它们被描述为谷歌DeepMind迄今最智能的开放模型。",
            "这些模型专为高级推理和代理工作流而构建。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "The introduction of Gemma 4 indicates Google DeepMind's ongoing commitment to open models, potentially advancing capabilities for advanced reasoning and agentic workflows across the AI industry.",
          "zh": "Gemma 4的推出表明谷歌DeepMind持续致力于开放模型，可能推动人工智能行业在高级推理和代理工作流方面的能力发展。"
        },
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
