          "zh": "Meta将利用员工按键数据训练AI模型"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Meta is implementing a new internal tool to record employee mouse movements and button clicks, converting this data to train its AI models.",
          "zh": "Meta正在部署一项新的内部工具，用于记录员工的鼠标移动和按键点击，并将这些数据转换为训练其AI模型的数据。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Meta developed a new internal tool for data collection from its employees.",
            "The tool captures employee interactions, including mouse movements, button clicks, and keyboard use.",
            "The collected data is specifically for training Meta's AI models and agents."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Meta开发了一项新的内部工具，用于收集员工数据。",
            "该工具捕获员工互动，包括鼠标移动、按键点击以及键盘使用。",
            "收集到的数据专门用于训练Meta的AI模型和AI代理。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
